From 50118ff519cae8edefa89fc475ba6090bafb0def Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Provant15 <me@provant.dev>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 21:53:17 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 13/22] feat(dashboard): redesign navigation - create button +
 personal submenu

- Add Create Server button to dashboard header (root admin only)
- Move API Keys and SSH Keys from sidebar into Personal dropdown submenu
- Simplify sidebar to just Servers and Settings
- Apply Personal submenu to desktop, server, and mobile dropdowns
- Replace ellipsis icon with gear for dropdown trigger
- Fix orphan separator for non-admin users
- Increase admin panel logo size to 45px

